{
    "word": "pong",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "6c626c40-dbe8-3b78-94ce-e450cb113b37",
                "word": "Pong",
                "pos": "name",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c38759d2-c385-3adc-b63f-bcafac8f4714",
                        "entry_id": "6c626c40-dbe8-3b78-94ce-e450cb113b37",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An early video game from Atari, resembling ping-pong, in which two players control paddles and attempt to intercept a ball."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "00ffe8ef-96fa-43e8-812a-64a038856169",
                                "sense_id": "c38759d2-c385-3adc-b63f-bcafac8f4714",
                                "text": "A good lunar lander or Pong-type game was all you needed to strike it rich!"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "df0b9e04-d8d7-4802-a06f-a4f74cc43372",
                                "sense_id": "c38759d2-c385-3adc-b63f-bcafac8f4714",
                                "text": "If the US invades Iraq, we'll see action all right, much more than we witnessed with the primitive Pong-ish effects delivered during Gulf War 1.0,"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1d87f77c-e963-40f8-bdd8-755a3b9e08c3",
                                "sense_id": "c38759d2-c385-3adc-b63f-bcafac8f4714",
                                "text": "The paddle controllers are necessary for playing Pong-style contests, and since two paddles share one controller input you can easily play doubles Pong with an extra set of paddles."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            },
            {
                "entry_id": "10c40ceb-c6b2-3e85-9379-5aeb44154ac7",
                "word": "pong",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "2e6150dc-7281-414b-a5f0-3de777216ac8",
                        "entry_id": "10c40ceb-c6b2-3e85-9379-5aeb44154ac7",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "pongs"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "4f696be0-254a-3588-812b-b59acb0ed029",
                        "entry_id": "10c40ceb-c6b2-3e85-9379-5aeb44154ac7",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A stench, a bad smell."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Commonwealth",
                            "Ireland",
                            "UK",
                            "slang"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0e34c4e1-8b72-4ad3-9ae5-c34f8c2468c5",
                                "sense_id": "4f696be0-254a-3588-812b-b59acb0ed029",
                                "text": "1992, Bryce Courtenay, Tandia, Volume 1, 2011, Read How You Want, page 109,\nShe sniffed, squiffing up her nose. ‘What a pong! Do they all smell like this?’"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "230d881a-294a-42cb-8b76-04daf572aad6",
                                "sense_id": "4f696be0-254a-3588-812b-b59acb0ed029",
                                "text": "I can remember calling round once and when she answered the door I was greeted by an unmistakable, noxious pong. “I can smell gas!”\nI said. “Oh, have I left the ring on?” she asked vaguely."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3006ead8-fa20-4392-8da0-0cae70685a62",
                                "sense_id": "4f696be0-254a-3588-812b-b59acb0ed029",
                                "text": "2000, Susan Sallis, 2011, unnumbered page,\n‘I see what you mean about the pong. I couldn′t smell it on myself but I can smell it on you!’"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "26c30e4f-9076-49cf-9684-fe26c5a957fc",
                                "sense_id": "4f696be0-254a-3588-812b-b59acb0ed029",
                                "text": "If you want to empty a crowded room strong body pong will usually do the trick."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "cd5373a8-c6bb-481f-be86-7234eb119095",
                        "source_entry_id": "10c40ceb-c6b2-3e85-9379-5aeb44154ac7",
                        "source_sense_id": "4f696be0-254a-3588-812b-b59acb0ed029",
                        "source_sense_description": "bad smell",
                        "target_lang_word": "smrad",
                        "target_lang_code": "cs",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "smrad",
                                "target_lang_code": "cs",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "98121201-cdad-3dc1-b3be-c968982c8898",
                                        "entry_id": "284d70c5-b959-308a-ad47-36bdd08168a2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "nepříjemný pach"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2b7fb3b3-17ff-48b6-ba1d-6446e5fc93c4",
                                                "sense_id": "98121201-cdad-3dc1-b3be-c968982c8898",
                                                "text": "V domě byl tak hrozný smrad, že jsme museli otevřít všechna okna."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2b8a7ce1-5c0b-48b0-ada8-556c5a014bce",
                                                "sense_id": "98121201-cdad-3dc1-b3be-c968982c8898",
                                                "text": "K zadrženj leyna (hnoge, trusu, howna) gsau nesčjlsné přjčnj klapky w tlustých střewách, zwláště pak na konci střewa spodnjho dwa swalové vůli podrobeni (sphincteres), gimiž se střewo uzawjrá, kdež leyno od žluči tmawé barwy nabýwá a smradu smyslům nepřjgemného."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "smrad",
                                "target_lang_code": "cs",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c3769e5a-55e8-3803-a26e-3f6589bcb3eb",
                                        "entry_id": "7abba16d-88ff-39b8-b3bd-fada897a4946",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "neúctyhodný, opovrženíhodný člověk, v současné češtině zejména výrazně mladší, než je mluvčí"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "derogatory"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "99a720f9-fe4e-4859-b6b3-b5196fbb6c9f",
                                                "sense_id": "c3769e5a-55e8-3803-a26e-3f6589bcb3eb",
                                                "text": "Ságner je chlap všemi mastmi mazaný a stejné jako Schröder nemá rád rezervní důstojníky. Říká o nich, že jsou to civilní smradi."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "80bb913b-7094-49a2-bed2-dcc25cdebd08",
                                                "sense_id": "c3769e5a-55e8-3803-a26e-3f6589bcb3eb",
                                                "text": "Ti kluci, co včera před samoškou přepadli tu stařenku, neměli ani dvacet let – věřil bys tomu? Takoví smradi!"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f4bc0814-b539-3b46-97d6-223c4a8b1900",
                                        "entry_id": "7abba16d-88ff-39b8-b3bd-fada897a4946",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "dítě"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "derogatory"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "137eca5f-e325-4c80-ac3b-311d0e0c0d09",
                                                "sense_id": "f4bc0814-b539-3b46-97d6-223c4a8b1900",
                                                "text": "Pocem, roztrhnu tě jak hada, ty smrade!"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
